</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>tsc-rs</code> (Effect built in)</td>
<td>11.13s</td>
<td>12.5×</td>
<td>1.89× faster</td>
<td><code>███</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>tsc</code> 7 + <code>@effect/tsgo</code></td>
<td>21.07s</td>
<td>6.6×</td>
